---LINES

mainv   = h   " main view                         "
mainvk  = c   "main view keys:"

cmded   = h   " command editor                  "
cmdedk  = c   "command editor keys:"

exit    = h   " exit trap                "
exitk   = c   "keys of trap on exit:"

hist    = h   " history view             "
histk   = c   "history view keys:"

runcmd  = hm "run a command"

---# m       = gm  - - - - " *)"
m       = g  - - - - " *)"
---# a       = cx "<1>"
---# b       = cx "<2>"
---# c       = cx "<3>"
a       = cx "*1"
b       = cx "*2"
c       = cx "*3"

X	= hx "[=]"
cmd     = hx "[a-z./]"
CMD     = hx "[0-9A-Z]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow -- context switching                                      
+                                             
+.mainvk............................... please, see 'man vash' for more details                                       
+ .:CA switch between editor and main                                         
+ .'uppercase                               .:HE... - help            
+     execute predefined command   .a       .:EX... - exit,return           
+     edit a command from template .b       .:CA    - cancel                
+ .'lowercase                                
+     type a command from scratch  .c       .mainv............................. 
+                                            ^ .:CA       ^    .cmd... .CMD....
+.histk................................      :   :     .X.:          :   :   :
+ .:CA    return to editor untouched         :   : .hist..........   :   : .a:
+ .:NL... take a command to editor           :   :    ^     .:NL...  : .b:   :
+                                            :   :    :        :   .c:   :   :
+.cmdedk...............................      : .:CA .:HE...    :     :   :   :
+ .:HE... switch to history view             : .cmded......................  :  
+ .:NL... run a command, sync history        :        ^            .:NL...   :
+                                            :      .c:              :       :    
+.exitk................................     .:CA      :              :       :    
+ .:SP...| .:CA return to main view         .:SP... .cmd...          :       :    
+ .'lovercase  return to editor             .exit.......... <- .runcmd.........     
+                                       

---END                                                                         
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
+                                     .m. see 'man vash' for details


  .mainv............................. 
  .CMD.... .cmd...     ^     .:CA  ^  
   :   :   :         .X:       :   :  
 .a:   :   : .hist..........   :   :  
   : .b:   :     ^   .:NL...   :   :  
   :   : .c:     :     :       :   :  
   :   :   : .:HE...   :     .:CA  :  
   : .cmded......................  :  
   :   .:NL...          ^          :  
   :     :            .c:          :  
   :     :              :        .:CA  
   :     :            .cmd... .:SP...  
  .runcmd........ -> .exit...........  
